{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'closeout|association|review policy|review-policy' .pose/knowledge -g '*.md'\"","aggregated_output":".pose/knowledge/2026-10-27-handoff-delegation-mcp-round5.md:45:Spec: .pose/specs/2026-10-26-pose-delegation-mcp.md. Consumed knowledge: knowledge:delegation-observation-round4, knowledge:delegation-routing-round3 and knowledge:delegated-rounds-legacy-status. Canonical validation: .pose/results/delivery-validation.json. Local probes, seven mutations and reports: .review-work/round5/ (deliberately untracked). Native bundle and attestation IDs are recorded in the spec Final Report after closeout.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-02-handoff-agency-readiness-outcome-review.md:32:authorized answer, replay, closeout restriction removal and return after subject\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-18-handoff-pose-b06-source-coverage-closeout.md:3:slug: pose-b06-source-coverage-closeout\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-18-handoff-pose-b06-source-coverage-closeout.md:16:# handoff: pose-b06-source-coverage-closeout\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-09-24-handoff-multirepo-review-continuation.md:12:  commands: [\"pose review verify spec:pose-agent-project-context\", \"pose closeout-check roadmap:pose-multirepo-foundation\", \"pose validate --strict --module pose-mcp --json .pose/results/delivery-validation.json --report\"]\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-09-24-handoff-multirepo-review-continuation.md:33:roadmap's four milestones and roadmap closeout remain open.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-16-decision-log-module-metadata-discovery-invalidates-review-provenance.md:28:`pose-gate-closeout-procedure` session note this decision-log\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-16-decision-log-module-metadata-discovery-invalidates-review-provenance.md:70:  `module-metadata.json`, per `pose-gate-closeout-procedure` — this is\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-16-decision-log-module-metadata-discovery-invalidates-review-provenance.md:81:- knowledge: session note `pose-gate-closeout-procedure` (this repository's\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:27:`pose_closeout_state(include_plan=true)` compartilham o plano e seus erros Git.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:33:1. Canonical worktree: /tmp/pose-b07-closeout-work, branch impl/pose-b07-git-snapshot-integrity. Merge a4c58e9 preserves the full PR195 history through 23643a2 and the original native start. Do not overwrite concurrent documentation changes in the shared checkout.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:35:3. Review R1 requested changes, now fixed: persisted runs require Git, closeout exceptions require regular materialization, history sorts instants with validated probes. Review R2 found the remaining persisted-materialization gap; Review R3 accepted its correction with no remaining functional finding. The reports record the actual separate same-vendor execution identity. The cross-vendor attempt hit its weekly limit; no cross-vendor approval is claimed.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:36:4. Finish artifact/surface checks, native sealed review and closeout before done or adoption. Default artifact attribution reconciled 82 claims with no errors. The Harne8 binding still points at 8aa729a7; do not update it merely because local tests pass.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:48:@pose-maintainers coordena a verificação dos registros nativos de closeout e eventual adoção; consulte o Final Report da spec para o resultado final.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:53:- [ADR MCP](../adr/2026-10-20-expose-the-closeout-execution-plan-as-an-opt-in-mcp-projection.md).\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-13-decision-log-review-assurance-requires-cryptographic-proof.md:26:Direct disclosure, verify, review-check, closeout and attribution consume the same authority proof check. Invalid proof never yields a verified claim that could authenticate human confirmation. No records, policy, schema or capability adoption are rewritten. Current issuer pins/grants and current expiry semantics remain; historical trust and reuse provenance require the separate B04 delta.\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:178:de gate executada e registrada na spec, changelog fragment, closeout com\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-28-handoff-delegated-conclusions-round4.md:44:Spec: .pose/specs/2026-10-27-pose-delegated-review-conclusions.md. Review report and independent probes: .review-work/round4/report.md. The spec Final Report records the sealed bundle and attestation after closeout. No upstream contribution draft, issue or PR was created.\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-13-handoff-pr15-component-aware-review-provenance.md:55:  `pose closeout-check` and the spec closeout flow.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:31:global seguinte falhou por agregação das closures de closeout e diagnósticos\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:36:bundle final, revisão Claude, atestação ou closeout. Os registros abaixo conservam\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:82:5. Aplicar o closeout nativo, repetir os gates pós-fechamento e publicar sem\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-03-decision-log-project-agnostic-assessment-evidence.md:76:  antes do closeout.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-13-decision-log-adr-sealed-review-bundles-review.md:20:The current full-body review scope digest lets closeout bookkeeping alter the\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-14-decision-log-escalation-validate-native.md:45:  review closeout. Success means zero new uncovered failures, not deletion of\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-15-decision-log-self-referential-policy-template-contamination.md:95:  `--module pose-mcp/internal/mcpserver` before closeout.\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-15-decision-log-self-referential-policy-template-contamination.md:96:- `pose check --strict` at release-closeout time, once this change is\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-08-15-decision-log-self-referential-policy-template-contamination.md:98:  `[[pose-gate-closeout-procedure]]`-equivalent local convention: one commit,\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-15-decision-log-github-issue-closing-keyword-format.md:37:roadmap/milestone closeout, unrelated to GitHub issues — plus these two new\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-15-decision-log-github-issue-closing-keyword-format.md:75:  in `pose-spec-closeout` checks for or prompts a linked-issue close. Spec\n.pose/knowledge/2026-08-15-decision-log-github-issue-closing-keyword-format.md:77:  structured signal a closeout tool could act on even if one existed.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
